{'symbol': 'AEE', 'date': '2021-07-15 11:33:00', 'title': 'AMEREN RECOGNIZED AS A BEST PLACE TO WORK FOR DISABILITY INCLUSION', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS, JULY 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ONE GROUP THAT CAN GET OVERLOOKED IN THE DIVERSITY, EQUITY AND INCLUSION CONVERSATION ARE THOSE WITH DISABILITIES – BUT NOT AT AMEREN CORPORATION (NYSE: AEE). ONCE AGAIN, THE COMPANY HAS RECEIVED A PERFECT 100% ON THE DISABILITY EQUALITY INDEX (DEI), RECOGNIZING ITS PROGRAMS AND POLICIES THAT PROMOTE INCLUSIVENESS FOR AMEREN EMPLOYEES, CUSTOMERS AND SUPPLIERS WITH DISABILITIES.'}